@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy"; }
<div class="container py-4" style="max-width:780px">
    <h1 class="mb-3">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>We collect the information needed to run your account and deliver your orders: your name, e-mail, phone number, delivery addresses and order history.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How we protect it</h2>
    <p>Passwords are never stored in readable form. They are hashed with PBKDF2 (100,000 iterations of HMAC-SHA256) using a unique random salt for every account. Sessions use secure, HTTP-only cookies, and every form is protected against cross-site request forgery.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How we use it</h2>
    <p>Order history is used to keep stock levels accurate, forecast demand, suggest related products and detect suspicious orders. When data is exported for research, customer identities are replaced with pseudonyms.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can update your profile and addresses at any time from your account. To close your account, contact us through the contact page.</p>
</div>
